mechanism "E1 dehydration of cyclohexanol"

[H:2][O:1][CH:3]1[CH:4]([H:5])CCCC1 + [H:6][OH2+:7]
  lp 1 -> 6
  bond 6-7 -> 7
-->
[H:2][O+:1]([H:6])[CH:3]1[CH:4]([H:5])CCCC1 + [OH2:7]
  bond 3-1 -> 1
--> "slow"
[CH+:3]1[CH:4]([H:5])CCCC1 + [H:2][O:1][H:6] + [OH2:7]
  lp 7 -> 5
  bond 5-4 -> 4-3
-->
[CH:3]1=[CH:4]CCCC1 + [H:5][OH2+:7]
